' Given: a RumAgent
'  When: call the failOperation method with an invalid failure reason
'  Then: do not dispatch any event to the RumScope
'----------------------------------------------------------------
function RumAgentTest__WhenFailOperationWithInvalidReason_ThenDoNotDispatch() as string
    ' Given
    fakeName = IG_GetString(32)

    ' When
    m.testedNode@.failOperation(fakeName, "invalid_reason")
